  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 50 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> –</p>\n<p>A living mossrock is a strange, thrumming stone which seems to teem with vibrant, lush moss to the touch which are commonly found in areas with strong fey presence.</p>\n<p><strong>Power Component</strong><br>\n<strong>Doses</strong> 1 (50 gp); <strong>Focus</strong> 20 (1,000 gp); <strong>Spells</strong> polymorph spells or Fallen Fey sphere effects</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> When you use a living mossrock as a material component or focus for a spell or sphere effect with the polymorph descriptor or a Fallen Fey sphere effect, treat the spell or sphere effect’s caster level as if it were 1 higher for the purposes of duration.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/equipment#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
